      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FOR SIXES (5) has the hoof on the till after three straight placings. Went back from a similar barrier last start then worked home in good style to finish less than 5 metres from the winner at Penrith. Missed by just a nose there prior. Could break through. PELIGROSO (6) did a good job to score last start by 2.7 metres in a nice return to form at this venue. Draws wider but with even luck he is capable of taking this out. UPSTREAM (4) was a little disappointing when midfield at her most recent appearance but had been racing consistently prior so may be worth another chance. SPECTA (7) has been racing well at Penrith with two close-up efforts since a win from the back row. Draws wide but can feature with even luck.",
